OL,3,GNEWSAPaddy 'the Baddy' joins mental
OL,4,Ahealth fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FUFC fighter Paddy Pimblett has joined
OL,7,FLiverpool FC's mental health campaign.
OL,9,FIn a video released by the club, Paddy
OL,10,F"the Baddy" from Huyton, Liverpool,
OL,11,Fspoke of a close friend taking his own
OL,12,Flife and said it was "shocking" that it
OL,13,Fhappens every 90 minutes in the UK.
OL,15,FThe 31-year-old has urged men to speak
OL,16,Fout on World Mental Health Day, as he
OL,17,Fsaid he had had his own mental health
OL,18,Fstruggles.
OL,20,FThe lifelong Liverpool fan said: "I
OL,21,Fthought about suicide a couple of
OL,22,Ftimes" but added "I'm glad I'm here".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
